569,712,708 bytes. The pinned MAME source identifies the Simpsons
main processor as Konami 053248 with a banked code window and the
audio processor as Z80. The Ghidra archive contains standard 6809
and Z80 languages; custom Konami compatibility is not yet established.
No complete function inventory or Rust mapping has
passed acceptance. The existing MAME capture and migration ledger
is retained; no historical research has been deleted.

